ot like i was  ever in a situation where really i  probably couldn't go to work or there  wasn't flexibilities at work definitely  because i had to start at seven so that  was hard and i broke up with my partner  so that made it difficult but  there's always a solution there was  never a time where  i was like i'm giving up because that's  what it really is like yes it's hard it  is hard you've decided to have a child  so that is your responsibility so now  it's your responsibility to make that  happen and still build your career and  if people don't  in my opinion  there's never really a strong enough  reason  besides the fact that you decided that  you're not going to do it the  recruitment mentors podcast is proudly  sponsored by vincerie and the  award-winning sauce breaker
 

